// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`agentCatalog > lists matching components, hardware and supplies 1`] = `
"Components (exact manufacturer geometry; size is x × y × z in mm as placed with rotation [0, 0, 0]):
Servos:
- component:feetech-sts3215 — Feetech STS3215 · 45.22 × 24.72 × 37.8 mm · Stall torque 19.5 kg·cm @ 7.4 V (C001) · 30 kg·cm @ 12 V (C018); Speed 0.192 s/60° @ 7.4 V; Voltage 4–7.4 V (C001) · 4–14 V (C018) · Mounting: Case 45.2 × 24.7 × 35 mm. Output spline 25T, Ø5.9 mm, 3.4 mm proud, axis 12.5 mm from the case center; horn screw M3 × 6. Rear idler boss Ø6 mm, 4.1 mm proud. Aluminium horns on both faces: Ø19.95, 4 × M3 threaded on a Ø14 circle, faces 1.4 mm beyond the case, so a U-bracket bolts to both. 4× M2 on the top and bottom faces, 20.5 mm apart across the width (Feetech STS3215 drawing).
  Versions (buy one; put it in the key): component:feetech-sts3215|c001 = 7.4 V (C001), stall 1.91 N·m, rated 0.49 N·m at 7.4 V (input 4–7.4 V), stall 2.5 A; component:feetech-sts3215|c018 = 12 V (C018), stall 2.94 N·m, rated 0.98 N·m at 12 V (input 4–14 V), stall 2.7 A; component:feetech-sts3215|c044 = 7.4 V, 1:191 (C044), stall 2.69 N·m, rated 0.88 N·m at 7.4 V (input 4–7.4 V); component:feetech-sts3215|c046 = 7.4 V, 1:147 (C046), stall 1.41 N·m, rated 0.47 N·m at 7.4 V (input 4–7.4 V)
- component:feetech-sts3250 — Feetech STS3250 · 45.22 × 24.72 × 37.8 mm · Stall torque 50 kg·cm (4.9 N·m) at 12 V; Speed 0.133 s/60° (75 rpm) at 12 V; Voltage 6–12 V · Mounting: Case 45.2 × 24.7 × 35 mm, same as the STS3215. 4× M2 on the top and bottom faces, 20.5 mm apart across the width. Output spline 25T, Ø5.9 mm, horn screw M3 × 6; rear idler boss Ø6 mm.
  Actuator: stall 4.90 N·m, rated 1.57 N·m at 12 V (input 6–12 V), stall 4.2 A
- component:waveshare-st3215-hs — Waveshare ST3215-HS · 45.22 × 24.72 × 37.8 mm · Stall torque 20 kg·cm (2.0 N·m) at 12 V; Speed 0.094 s/60° (106 rpm) at 12 V; Voltage 6–12.6 V · Mounting: Case 45.2 × 24.7 × 35 mm. Output axis 10.1 mm from the output end. Output face: 4 holes in two columns 20.7 mm apart, rows 20.5 mm apart (M2 on Feetech’s drawing). Ø19.2 aluminium horns on both faces, 4 holes on a 14 mm circle.
Grippers:
- component:so101-gripper — SO-101 Gripper · 65.6 × 52 × 106.4 mm · Actuator 1× Feetech STS3215; DOF 1 (revolute jaw); Travel −10° to +100° · Mounting: Static jaw and servo as published in the SO-101 model; the moving jaw is shown at 0°. Mounts to the wrist-roll servo horn with 4× M3 × 6."
`;

exports[`agentCatalog > lists matching components, hardware and supplies 2`] = `
"
Hardware (generated to ISO/DIN dimensions): hardware:<type>|<size>|<length mm>[|<finish>|<drive>], e.g. hardware:socket_head|M3|10, hardware:pan_head|M3|8|zinc|phillips, hardware:heat_insert|M3, hardware:bearing|608
- hardware:socket_head — Socket Head Screw (Cap screw with a tall round head); sizes M2, M2.5, M3, M4, M5, M6, M8, M10, M12; lengths per size; drives hex, torx, phillips, pozidriv, slotted (default hex)

Supplies (bought, not modeled: batteries, power, wiring, filament). Add them to the BOM with set_build({ extras }), not add_parts; model the battery or converter bay around the spec size:
- supply:hex-key-set — Hex Key Set · 1.5–5 mm metric hex drivers (M2–M5 socket heads)"
`;

exports[`agentCatalog > lists matching components, hardware and supplies 3`] = `
"Components (exact manufacturer geometry; size is x × y × z in mm as placed with rotation [0, 0, 0]):
Microcontrollers:
- component:seeed-xiao-esp32s3 — Seeed XIAO ESP32S3 · 22.48 × 17.78 × 4.46 mm · SoC ESP32-S3R8, 240 MHz dual-core; Memory 8 MB PSRAM · 8 MB flash; Wireless Wi-Fi 2.4 GHz · Bluetooth LE 5 · Mounting: PCB 21.135 × 17.78 mm, R1.905 corners, no mounting holes. Pin rows 15.24 mm apart; solder or socket it.

Supplies (bought, not modeled: batteries, power, wiring, filament). Add them to the BOM with set_build({ extras }), not add_parts; model the battery or converter bay around the spec size:
- supply:lipo-2s-2200 — 2S LiPo 2200 mAh · 7.4 V nominal (8.4 V full), 2200 mAh, 25C+, XT60, about 105 × 34 × 18 mm · about 120 g
- supply:lipo-3s-2200 — 3S LiPo 2200 mAh · 11.1 V nominal (12.6 V full), 2200 mAh, 25C+, XT60, about 105 × 34 × 25 mm · about 172 g
- supply:lipo-balance-charger — LiPo Balance Charger · 2S–4S balance charger, XT60 output, USB-C or AC input
- supply:lipo-safe-bag — LiPo Safe Bag · Fire-resistant charging bag, fits a 2200 mAh pack
- supply:lipo-voltage-alarm — LiPo Voltage Alarm · 1S–8S cell checker with low-voltage buzzer, plugs into the balance lead · about 9 g"
`;

